> Interpretation and limits

Node arrays and in-order IDs come from the sorting kernel, rather than
rebuilding a separate tree for the diagram. The default comparison cap makes
pathological inputs explicit. This is an unbalanced integer sorter, not a
production balanced-tree claim.

Every figure is saved locally by its complete editable program. No separate
reconstruction supplies algorithm state. Counters describe the selected events,
not elapsed time or peak memory.

